+/*
+ * Number of sectors in the mounted disc image, 0 without a disc.
+ *
+ * Why this exists: a plugin whose feature needs data added to the disc (for
+ * example a rebuilt image with extra files appended) must know whether that
+ * image is the one mounted, and guest RAM cannot tell it reliably -- a save
+ * state restores RAM from whatever disc it was made on, before the game has
+ * read anything from the current one.
+ */
+uint32_t psx_mod_disc_sector_count(void);
